<DocsLayout
  title="Overview"
  subtitle="Local-first CAD/CAM desktop app. Work-package status is the Status column of specs/00-overview.md §4. Sequence of remaining work is specs/roadmap/README.md."
  description="CADCAMFUN v6 overview: product, stack, work-package status, repository layout, commands, and the current roadmap step."
