  <section id="layout" class="doc-section">
    <h2>Layout</h2>
    <p>
      Workspaces are <code>packages/*</code> and <code>apps/*</code> (root <code>package.json</code>).
      <code>packages/web</code> is this Astro site. <code>packages/httpapi-codegen</code> and
      <code>packages/nikcli-plugin</code> are in the tree and are not in the overview’s layout
      diagram; they are real packages.
    </p>
    <DocCode language="text" title="Repository (paths that exist)">
{`packages/
  db/               @cadcamfun/db
  core/             @cadcamfun/core
  api/              @cadcamfun/api
  ai/               @cadcamfun/ai
  plugin-sdk/       @cadcamfun/plugin-sdk
  vcs/              @cadcamfun/vcs
  workflow/         @cadcamfun/workflow
  httpapi-codegen/  @cadcamfun/httpapi-codegen
  nikcli-plugin/    @nikoemme_/cadcamfun-nikcli-plugin
  web/              @cadcamfun/web          this docs site
apps/
  sidecar/          @cadcamfun/sidecar
  desktop/          @cadcamfun/desktop
  mobile/           @cadcamfun/mobile
specs/              contracts (00–29, roadmap/, ai/, api-inventory.md)
scripts/            build.ts and release helpers
.github/workflows/  ci.yml, build-platforms.yml, release.yml, ios.yml
.reference/         legacy Next.js + Prisma, git-ignored, read-only`}
    </DocCode>
    <div class="doc-grid not-prose">
      <DocCard title="Quickstart" eyebrow="Run" href="/docs/guides/quickstart">
